      "at": "2026-11-16T07:56:55.527Z",
      "type": "agent_text",
      "text": "I didn't place an order. The store can't confirm that any dock under $150 runs two 4K 60 Hz displays from a USB-C laptop.\n\n- **Demo Dock Duo (OAW-DOCK-04), $129.00:** This is the only plausible fit. Its USB-C port check passed, but the store hasn't listed how many 4K 60 Hz displays it supports (`max_displays_4k60`). The compatibility result is \"unknown\", so I can't treat it as confirmed.\n- **Demo Dock Duo Lite (OAW-DOCK-03), $89.00:** It's incompatible. It supports only one 4K 60 Hz display.\n- **Demo Dock Travel (OAW-DOCK-01), $39.00, and Demo Dock Solo (OAW-DOCK-02), $59.00:** Both are listed with one display at 4K 60 Hz, so they can't run two.\n\nThose four docks are the store's whole range under $150.\n\nYou have two options:\n1. Ask the store to confirm the Duo's 4K 60 Hz display count. I can then re-check it and quote it.\n2. Loosen the requirement, for example to one 4K 60 Hz display, and I'll get a quote for a dock that meets it.\n\nWhich would you like?"
    }
